Slide\nNext Slide\nEmergency Pet Care When Your Pet’s Life is on the Line\nThe MedVet West Chester team is a trusted partner in care for family veterinarians and pet lovers in the West Chester area and surrounding communities.\nAs part of MedVet’s nationwide network of leading veterinary hospitals, the team at MedVet West Chester offers advanced, comprehensive emergency pet care. Whether it’s a late-night emergency or a weekend mishap, you can count on us. We know your pet is an important part of your family, and emergencies can be stressful, so we treat your pet like our own and communicate with you and your family veterinarian every step of the way.\nMedVet West Chester Caregivers\nSearch by Name\nFilter by Specialty\nAll Specialties\nEmergency Medicine\nOur Hospital Leaders\nJennifer Wells, DVM, DACVIM (SAIM)\nMedical Director\nHeidi Hill, MA, CVPM\nHospital Director\nOur Doctors\nSarah Abdelmessih\n, DVM, MS\nEmergency Medicine\nDawna Boudot\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nTimothy Cappel\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nBrittany Cramer\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nTy Gillenwaters\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nLauren Grosheim\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nCaitlyn Gunther\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nAlena Gurevich\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nEmery Hawkins\n, MVB\nEmergency Medicine\nPatrick Hunt\n, DVM, MBA\nEmergency Medicine\nTaylor Johannigman\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nWilliam Peebles\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nGabrielle Quinn\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nCade R.W. Rogers\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nDory Sanders\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nMackenzie Sigman\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nAnna Studebaker\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nSarah Sunday\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nAlexis Thomas\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nHillary Voris\n, DVM, MS\nEmergency Medicine\nNora Westman\n, MVB\nEmergency Medicine\nShow All Doctors (\n21\n)\nPet Stories\n“The care my pup got at MedVet was incredible. Quick check-in, great communication, and\nso much kindness from the team. You can tell they really love animals.”\n“I was so nervous bringing Luna in after hours, but everyone at MedVet was amazing. They\nwere calm, kind, and professional. It was exactly what I needed in the middle of the night. I\nleft feeling relieved knowing my cat was in great hands.”\nPrevious Story\nNext Story\nFinancing Options\nWe understand that planning for the cost of care is important. Special financing and payment arrangements are available for qualified pet owners through an independent company, CareCredit.\nLearn More\nFind a location\nEmergency Care\nFind Care\nFind a Location\nFind A Doctor\nResources\nPet Care Resources\nClinical Studies\nAbout\nWe Are MedVet\nMedVet Experience\nOur Leaders\nOur Founders\nNewsroom\nDiversity, Inclusion, & Belonging\nCommunity Support\nFAQs\nContact Us\nFor Veterinarians\nClinical Studies\nContinuing Education\nCareers\nMedVet Open Positions at New Hospitals\nMedVet Training Programs\nSpecialties\nSpecialties Overview\nAnesthesia & Pain Management\nAvian & Exotics\nCardiology\nCritical Care\nDentistry & Oral Surgery\nDermatology\nEmergency Medicine\nIntegrative Medicine\nInternal Medicine\nInterventional Radiology\nMedical Oncology\nNeurology & Neurosurgery\nOphthalmology\nRadiation Oncology\nRadiology\nRehabilitation\nSports Medicine\nSurgery\nUrgent Care\nSocial\nInstagram\nLinkedIn\nFacebook\nYouTube\nPartners\nVetRad\nVeterinary Eye Institute\nMedVet Suppliers\nLegal\nPrivacy Policy\nCA Privacy\nYour Privacy Choices\nTerms\nTransparency in Coverage\nTax Information",
