      "description": "Emergency Pet Care When Your Pet’s Life is on the Line The MedVet West Chester team is a trusted partner in care for family veterinarians and pet lovers in the West Chester area and surrounding communities. As part of MedVet’s nationwide network of leading veterinary hospitals, the team at MedVet West Chester offers advanced, comprehensive emergency pet care. Whether it’s a late-night emergency or a weekend mishap, you can count on us. We know your pet is an important part of your family, and emergencies can be stressful, so we treat your pet like our own and communicate with you and your family veterinarian every step of the way.",
